{"id": "b51c9703-686d-4eb3-93e4-34f7e24cb798", "slug": "ashen-aurora", "title": "Ashen Aurora", "description": "Ashen Aurora Button Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Ashen Aurora\"\ndescription: \"Ashen Aurora Button Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#050505\"\n  secondary: \"#18181B\"\n  accent: \"#050505\"\n  background: \"#050505\"\n  surface: \"#18181B\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Ashen Aurora\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Sourany Phomhome (@sou). Views: 5; favorites: 4; remixes: 0.\nTags: button, animated, cta, action, effect.\n## Overview\nAshen Aurora Button Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nDISCOVER THE ASHEN AURORA A boundless threshold fusing volumetric light, quiet motion, and architectural elegance. INITIATE SEQUENCE DIVE BEYOND THE SURFACE ↓\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: DISCOVER THE ASHEN AURORA.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #050505, secondary #18181B, accent #050505, background #050505, surface #18181B, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Ashen Aurora</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"antialiased bg-[#050505] text-white min-h-screen overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-white/20 selection:text-white relative flex flex-col font-sans\">\n\n    <!-- Three.js Canvas -->\n    <canvas id=\"webgl-canvas\" class=\"fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none z-0 mix-blend-screen\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Header -->\n    <header class=\"relative z-50 flex justify-between items-center w-full px-6 md:px-12 py-8 mix-blend-difference text-white\">\n        <button class=\"flex items-center justify-center opacity-70 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300\" aria-label=\"Search\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:magnifer-linear\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n        </button>\n\n        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center opacity-90\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:layers-linear\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" style=\"transform: rotate(45deg);\"></iconify-icon>\n        </div>\n\n        <button class=\"flex items-center justify-center opacity-70 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300\" aria-label=\"Menu\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:hamburger-menu-linear\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n        </button>\n    </header>\n\n    <!-- Main Content -->\n    <main class=\"relative z-40 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-center px-6 md:px-12 w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto pt-10 md:pt-0\">\n        <div class=\"max-w-3xl\">\n            <!-- Masked Staggered Headline -->\n            <h1 class=\"text-5xl md:text-8xl leading-none tracking-tight uppercase font-light text-white mix-blend-difference flex flex-wrap gap-x-3 md:gap-x-4\">\n                <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block align-bottom pb-1\"><span class=\"reveal-word inline-block\" style=\"transform: translateY(110%);\">DISCOVER</span></span>\n                <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block align-bottom pb-1\"><span class=\"reveal-word inline-block\" style=\"transform: translateY(110%);\">THE</span></span>\n                <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block align-bottom pb-1\"><span class=\"reveal-word inline-block\" style=\"transform: translateY(110%);\">ASHEN</span></span>\n                <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block align-bottom pb-1\"><span class=\"reveal-word inline-block\" style=\"transform: translateY(110%);\">AURORA</span></span>\n            </h1>\n\n            <p class=\"mt-6 md:mt-8 text-base md:text-xl text-white/60 font-extralight max-w-sm md:max-w-md leading-relaxed tracking-wide opacity-0\" id=\"hero-subtext\">\n                A boundless threshold fusing volumetric light, quiet motion, and architectural elegance.\n            </p>\n\n            <!-- Custom CTA -->\n            <div class=\"mt-16 md:mt-24 relative inline-flex items-center opacity-0\" id=\"hero-cta\">\n                <div class=\"w-12 md:w-20 h-[1px] bg-white/20 relative top-3\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute right-0 top-0 w-[1px] h-3 bg-white/20\"></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"relative group block px-8 py-5 cursor-pointer ml-[-1px]\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-[1px] h-4 bg-white/20 transition-all duration-500 group-hover:h-full group-hover:bg-white/40\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-8 h-[1px] bg-white/20 transition-all duration-500 group-hover:w-full group-hover:bg-white/40\"></div>\n\n                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-[1px] h-4 bg-white/20 transition-all duration-500 group-hover:h-full group-hover:bg-white/40\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-8 h-[1px] bg-white/20 transition-all duration-500 group-hover:w-full group-hover:bg-white/40\"></div>\n\n                    <span class=\"relative z-10 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-white/80 font-extralight group-hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300\">\n                        INITIATE SEQUENCE\n                    </span>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- Footer Elements -->\n    <footer class=\"relative z-40 flex justify-between items-end w-full px-6 md:px-12 pb-8 mix-blend-difference\">\n        <p class=\"text-xs text-white/40 tracking-[0.2em] uppercase font-extralight opacity-0\" id=\"hero-bottom-text\">\n            DIVE BEYOND THE SURFACE &darr;\n        </p>\n\n        <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full border border-white/20 flex items-center justify-center opacity-0\" id=\"hero-circle\">\n            <div class=\"w-1 h-1 bg-white/50 rounded-full\"></div>\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            // GSAP Animations\n            gsap.to(\".reveal-word\", {\n                y: \"0%\",\n                duration: 1.4,\n                stagger: 0.12,\n                ease: \"power4.out\",\n                delay: 0.2,\n                scrollTrigger: {\n                    trigger: \"h1\",\n                    start: \"top 90%\",\n                }\n            });\n\n            gsap.to([\"#hero-subtext\", \"#hero-cta\", \"#hero-bottom-text\", \"#hero-circle\"], {\n                opacity: 1,\n                duration: 1.5,\n                stagger: 0.2,\n                ease: \"power2.out\",\n                delay: 1.2\n            });\n\n            // Three.js Setup\n            const canvas = document.getElementById('webgl-canvas');\n            const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ canvas, antialias: true, alpha: true });\n            renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n\n            const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n            const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(45, window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight, 0.1, 100);\n            camera.position.z = 10;\n\n            // 1. Gray God Rays via Custom Shader Plane\n            const rayGeo = new THREE.PlaneGeometry(40, 40);\n            const rayMat = new THREE.ShaderMaterial({\n                uniforms: {\n                    uTime: { value: 0 }\n                },\n                vertexShader: `\n                    varying vec2 vUv;\n                    void main() {\n                        vUv = uv;\n                        gl_Position = projectionMatrix * modelViewMatrix * vec4(position, 1.0);\n                    }\n                `,\n                fragmentShader: `\n                    varying vec2 vUv;\n                    uniform float uTime;\n\n                    void main() {\n                        vec2 p = vUv - 0.5;\n\n                        // Shift center for origin of rays\n                        p.x -= 0.2;\n                        p.y -= 0.2;\n\n                        float a = atan(p.y, p.x);\n                        float r = length(p);\n\n                        // Fake volumetric ray generation using sine waves\n                        float ray1 = sin(a * 12.0 + uTime * 0.4) * 0.5 + 0.5;\n                        float ray2 = sin(a * 8.0 - uTime * 0.25) * 0.5 + 0.5;\n                        float ray3 = sin(a * 18.0 + uTime * 0.6) * 0.5 + 0.5;\n\n                        float rays = (ray1 * ray2 * ray3);\n\n                        // Core glow\n                        float glow = exp(-r * 4.0);\n\n                        // Elegant gray tone matching original theme\n                        vec3 color = vec3(0.55, 0.58, 0.62);\n\n                        // Edge mask\n                        float mask = smoothstep(0.8, 0.0, r);\n\n                        float finalAlpha = (rays * 0.6 + glow * 0.8) * mask;\n                        gl_FragColor = vec4(color, finalAlpha * 0.7);\n                    }\n                `,\n                transparent: true,\n                blending: THREE.AdditiveBlending,\n                depthWrite: false\n            });\n            const rayMesh = new THREE.Mesh(rayGeo, rayMat);\n            rayMesh.position.set(0, 0, -8);\n            scene.add(rayMesh);\n\n            // 2. 3D Ring on Right Side\n            const ringGroup = new THREE.Group();\n            scene.add(ringGroup);\n\n            const matSilver = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({ color: 0xffffff, metalness: 1, roughness: 0.1 });\n            const matGlow = new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({ color: 0x949ca8, wireframe: true, transparent: true, opacity: 0.25 });\n            const matCore = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({ color: 0xe0e0e0, metalness: 0.8, roughness: 0.3 });\n\n            const ring1 = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.TorusGeometry(3.0, 0.02, 32, 128), matSilver);\n            const ring2 = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.TorusGeometry(3.1, 0.08, 16, 64), matGlow);\n            const ring3 = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.TorusGeometry(2.8, 0.015, 16, 128), matCore);\n\n            ring1.rotation.x = Math.PI / 2;\n            ring2.rotation.x = Math.PI / 2;\n            ring3.rotation.x = Math.PI / 2;\n\n            ringGroup.add(ring1, ring2, ring3);\n\n            // Ring Placement\n            function updateLayout() {\n                if (window.innerWidth < 768) {\n                    ringGroup.position.set(0, 2, -3);\n                } else {\n                    ringGroup.position.set(4, 0, -1);\n                }\n            }\n            updateLayout();\n\n            // Lighting\n            const ambient = new THREE.AmbientLight(0xffffff, 0.4);\n            scene.add(ambient);\n            const dirLight = new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xffffff, 3);\n            dirLight.position.set(5, 5, 2);\n            scene.add(dirLight);\n            const pointLight = new THREE.PointLight(0xa0a8b4, 5, 20);\n            pointLight.position.set(2, -2, 2);\n            scene.add(pointLight);\n\n            // Mouse Interaction Parallax\n            let mouseX = 0;\n            let mouseY = 0;\n            const windowHalfX = window.innerWidth / 2;\n            const windowHalfY = window.innerHeight / 2;\n\n            document.addEventListener('mousemove', (event) => {\n                mouseX = (event.clientX - windowHalfX) * 0.001;\n                mouseY = (event.clientY - windowHalfY) * 0.001;\n            });\n\n            // Resize Handler\n            window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                camera.aspect = window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight;\n                camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n                renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n                updateLayout();\n            });\n\n            // Animation Loop\n            const clock = new THREE.Clock();\n            function animate() {\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n                const time = clock.getElapsedTime();\n\n                // Update God Rays\n                rayMat.uniforms.uTime.value = time;\n\n                // Animate Rings\n                ring1.rotation.y = time * 0.1;\n                ring1.rotation.z = time * 0.05;\n\n                ring2.rotation.x = (Math.PI / 2) + Math.sin(time * 0.5) * 0.1;\n                ring2.rotation.y = -time * 0.08;\n\n                ring3.rotation.y = time * 0.15;\n                ring3.rotation.z = -time * 0.07;\n\n                // Float group\n                ringGroup.position.y = (window.innerWidth < 768 ? 2 : 0) + Math.sin(time * 0.8) * 0.15;\n                ringGroup.rotation.z = Math.cos(time * 0.5) * 0.05;\n\n                // Mouse Parallax Camera Ease\n                camera.position.x += (mouseX * 3 - camera.position.x) * 0.02;\n                camera.position.y += (-mouseY * 3 - camera.position.y) * 0.02;\n                camera.lookAt(scene.position);\n\n                renderer.render(scene, camera);\n            }\n            animate();\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "ashen-aurora.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/ashen-aurora.jpg", "source_name": "ashen-aurora-DESIGN.md", "views": 141, "forks": 7, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "8bd0314a-9525-4a13-996e-2c37cbd9e514", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T22:26:18.255617+00:00"}